<p>Lay a pressure triggered trap that explodes into a radius 2 wave of razor sharp wire, doing <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">156, 188, 212, 232, 250</acronym> physical damage. Those struck by the wire may be shredded, reducing accuracy, armor and defence by <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>Trap Mastery talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>Cunning 100">18, 22, 25, 27, 30.</acronym></p><p>This trap can use a primed trigger and a high level lure can trigger it.</p>